mockJoin.setRole("MASTER");          // full master
mockJoin.setTerm(41);                // older term
mockJoin.setVersion(6);              // older version

boolean ok = isFullMasterWithOlderState.test(mockJoin); // should be true
```

Replace the `Join` construction with whatever mechanism your application uses to obtain real `Join` objects. The predicate will automatically perform the necessary comparisons for you.

